  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 Hotfix Release:\n\t\t\t- CRITICAL FIX: Resolved \"Designer Poisoning\" (CS0029) crash. Added [DesignerSerializationVisibility.Hidden] to complex properties (Rows, CurrentPage, DataSource) to prevent Visual Studio from writing broken serialization code into Form.Designer.cs during drag-and-drop.\n\n\t\t\tv1.0.0 Initial Stable Release:\n\t\t\t- Hardware-accelerated GDI+ rendering engine (Zero flickering).\n\t\t\t- Built-in Pagination and Virtual Mode.\n\t\t\t- In-cell analytics: DataBars and Vector Sparklines.\n\t\t\t- Built-in Zero-Dependency Data Export (PDF, CSV, JSON, XML).",
